==French==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|VL.|fr}} root {{m|la|*salāre}}, from a change in conjugation of {{etyl|la|fr}} {{term|salīre|lang=la}}, present active infintive of {{term|saliō||I salt|lang=la}}, from {{term|sal|lang=la}}. Compare Italian {{term|salare|lang=it}}, Romanian ''[[săra]]'', Spanish, Portuguese, and Catalan ''[[salar]]''.

